16	 * {@link AuditOwnerCreated} has written the human-readable line. Runs once the owner is persisted, so
17	 * it carries the generated id, the current primary identifier and the derived membership level. Each
18	 * event takes the next value from a process-wide monotonic sequence so consumers can order creates
19	 * and detect gaps.
